OL,3,GNEWSAI moved from Australia to the
OL,4,AWelsh valleys because the houses are so
OL,5,Acheap
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's ideal if you're commuting, and
OL,8,Feverything's virtually on your
OL,9,Fdoorstep, so a really affordable area
OL,10,Fto come to," he said.
